### ====================================================
### Practical 07: Employee Management MongoDB Atlas API Tests
### ====================================================

### 1. Server Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### 2. Get All Employees (With Pagination)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/employees?page=1&limit=10

### 3. Filter Employees by Department (Engineering)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/employees?department=Engineering

### 4. Filter by Salary Range (Salary >= 70000)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/employees?minSalary=70000

### 5. Search by Name or Role (Lead)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/employees?search=Lead

### 6. Get Employee by Custom empId (EMP101)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/employees/EMP101

### 7. Create New Employee (POST)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empId": "EMP106",
  "firstName": "Neha",
  "lastName": "Kapoor",
  "email": "neha.kapoor@company.com",
  "phone": "9812300099",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "designation": "Frontend React Specialist",
  "salary": 78000,
  "status": "Active"
}

### 8. Update Employee Details (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/employees/EMP106
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "designation": "Senior Frontend Architect",
  "salary": 88000
}

### 9. Get Department Analytics & Metrics (MongoDB Aggregation)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/employees/stats/summary

### 10. Delete Employee (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/employees/EMP106
